# thinking — a goal refused by the means is withheld from the mind that chose it, and only that one
#
# Ripelore chooses to examine the tree and Knack, which does not observe, refuses it
# (ExamineActionNeedsObservationRule). Asked again about the same object, Ripelore is no longer
# offered examining — it would converge on it and be refused the same way — so the pinned goal
# misses and it settles on the only other goal there is. Scientific Research, a different mind, is
# still offered examining — and since it was refused once already this phase, the means is no longer
# left to chance: only an action modus mentis that observes is offered, with no refusal left to it.
# `means none` hands the draw back to the RNG, so the button can only appear if that narrowing ran.
#
# Buttons are asserted as "] <goal>" — the tail of "[Knack ●] climb …" — which the prose never
# contains. The second think's own button is the proof of the first half: the goal draw is pinned
# to examine, so examine would have been taken had it still been on offer.
#
# --organs pineal_gland=0: no iterative thinking, so the refused mind stops and the second mind is the one
# that retries -- the per-mind rule this script is about. With a retry, the first mind retries itself.
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Crown" --period dawn --observe-only "Test Giant Tree" --grant-mm knack,woodcraft,scientific_research --means-only knack --organs pineal_gland=0

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal examine
advance 12 180

# Think with Ripelore; Knack refuses to examine.
click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
expect I want to act, not to stand and

# Ripelore again: examining is withheld, so the button is something else.
click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
expect ] climb back down the test giant tree
expect-not ] examine the test giant tree closely

# Scientific Research: still offered examining, carried out by an observing means. Pinned to
# Woodcraft: several held means observe (a will counts), and one of them acts discreetly.
means woodcraft
click keyword 0
choose 0
choose scientific_research
advance 12 180
expect ] examine the test giant tree closely

allow-flag-miss --goal-only
quit
